{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"RecurringJournalEntries\">Recurring Journal Entries</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Pending\">Pending</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Count Journal JournalEntries RecurringJournalEntries Repeat To ToDate\">Recurring journal entries allow you to automate frequently repeated journal entries in your accounting system.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Every EveryMonth Journal JournalEntries Manual On Rate To ToDate\">Instead of manually creating the same journal entries every month, quarter, or year, you can set them up once to generate automatically according to your specified schedule.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Depreciation Expenses Is On\">Common uses include recording monthly depreciation, allocating recurring expenses across departments, or recognizing deferred revenue on a regular basis.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Allocation Amount And Automatic Count Create Journal JournalEntries JournalEntry Location On RecurringJournalEntry Settings To ToDate\">Each recurring journal entry can be configured with its own schedule, amounts, and account allocations. The system will automatically create the journal entries based on your settings.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Date Is Journal JournalEntry Next On RecurringJournalEntry To ToDate\">Displays the scheduled date for the next automatic creation of each recurring journal entry.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Automatic Date Is Journal JournalEntry On Rate Settings To ToDate Update\">This date is calculated based on your recurring schedule settings and updates automatically after each journal entry is generated.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Narration\">Narration</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Narration\">Narration</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Journal JournalEntry Narration On Rate\">Shows the narration text that will be included with each generated journal entry.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Automatic Copied Create Description Is Journal JournalEntry On To ToDate Transaction\">This description helps identify the purpose of the journal entry and is copied to each automatically created transaction.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "recurring-journal-entries"
}
